path             process 1 (shell)                                process 2 (browser)
/bin/ls          ls for this terminal                             ls for this terminal
/bin/cc          the compiler kept on the file server             the compiler kept on the file server
/usr/ana/notes   Ana's notes                                      Ana's notes
/dev/cons        this terminal's console                          this terminal's console
/net/tcp         this terminal's TCP stack                        the gateway's TCP stack (it reaches the outside network)
